buttons.description:
{image}

Tick the buttons on your remote. Next, you press them one after another: as soon as one is received, the next one comes up. You have {timeout} seconds for each.

You can add other buttons with your own names at the end.

progress.press_button:
{image}

**{position} of {total}: press {name}**

Point your remote at the receiver and press **{name}**. The next button comes up by itself.

